# Mandatory `/grill-me` (Strict)

**Do not guess requirements.** When anything is ambiguous, missing, or assumed, run `/grill-me` — do not proceed by filling gaps yourself.

## When `/grill-me` is required

Run it **before**:

- Writing or updating a feature spec (`/to-spec`)
- Changing architecture docs or ADRs
- Breaking work into tickets (`/to-tickets`) for a new feature area
- Writing production code (`/implement`, `/tdd`) for a ticket that has open questions

Also run it when the user gives a vague request ("build the upload flow", "add categorization") without settled edge cases, terms, or acceptance criteria.

**Architecture grilling topics** (always cover for new modules):

- Layer placement (routes vs service vs domain)
- API contract and error cases
- Game edge cases (duplicate draws, concurrent winners, ticket immutability, mark validation, state-machine transitions)
- What React shows vs what Bun computes
- Test seams and scenario list

## How to run it

```
/grill-me

[Scope: PRD section, architecture area, or ticket title]
Grill me on every ambiguous requirement, undefined term, and missing edge case.
Do not propose code or architecture until the frontier is empty and I confirm we have a shared understanding.
```

Use `/grill-with-docs` instead when decisions must be captured in `CONTEXT.md` or `docs/adr/` as you go.

## Rules during a grill session

- Ask the **whole frontier** each round — numbered questions with a recommended answer.
- **Never answer your own questions** or silently assume defaults.
- **Never skip to implementation** mid-session.
- Session is **incomplete** until the design-tree frontier is empty and the user confirms shared understanding.

## Gate — what may proceed without re-grilling

| Allowed to proceed | Blocked until grilled |
|---|---|
| Ticket with explicit acceptance criteria and no TBDs | Any "TBD", "probably", or assumed behavior |
| Spec published after a completed grill session | New scope added since last grill |
| Bug fix with clear repro and expected behavior | Behavior change or unclear expected outcome |

If in doubt, grill first.
